Look, another day, another right-wing ‘genius’ demanding we take him seriously. Meet Ian Carroll: the Domino’s pizza delivery boy turned conspiracy theorist who somehow convinced himself (and a few Rogan fans) that dropping out of high school makes him an ‘independent researcher.’

Buddy, the only thing you’ve researched is how to get a large pepperoni to the door in 30 minutes or less. Your ‘theories’ aren’t deep—they’re just reheated slop with extra cheese and zero facts.

